	(text "SUPPLY DECOUPLING / I2C PULL-UPS / DEFAULT MUTE"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 139.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "093482a5-5e54-4cab-8035-e7bc19faa30c")
	)
	(text "REFERENCES\nTI SLOS488F: pin table p4, Figure 45 p24, single-ended inputs p25.\nMicrochip DS70005402H: pin table pp13-15, Figure 3-31 p35,\npower p38, configuration pp42-45, host UART Figure 6-8 p47."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 233.68 246.38 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.016 1.016)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "10a0409a-7bca-47d4-9e74-9f3abfc60aae")
	)
	(text "1uF each: C9 at VDD_CP pin 20 / GND19; C10 at VDD_A12 / GND13.\nC11 flying capacitor CPP18 to CPN17. C12 from CPVSS15/16 to GND.\nAll are generic non-polar capacitors. Select dielectric, rating and package later."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 279.4 130.81 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.016 1.016)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "14ad99d8-21c4-4743-9459-b7a3ee05725b")
	)
	(text "CONTROL NETS (Firmware.ioc)\nPB6 -> I2C1_SCL; PB7 -> I2C1_SDA; PA3 -> AMP_ENABLE\nPA9 -> BM83 RXD; PA10 <- BM83 TXD\nPA4 -> BT_RESET (open drain); PA5 -> BT_WAKE; PA6 <- BT_WAKE_IND"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 246.38 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.016 1.016)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "20310442-7248-462e-bfaf-c9926d69dc36")
	)
	(text "1. BM83 BAT_IN requires 3.2-4.2V. VBAT is the battery rail, not the MCU 3.0V output.\n2. Configure BM83 for HOST mode and SINGLE-ENDED analog output. Leave AOHPM unused.\n3. TPA6130A2: I2C address 0x60 (7-bit); firmware must enable stereo outputs and set a safe volume.\n4. Input audio feeds LEFTINM / RIGHTINM. Positive inputs are AC-grounded at the source through matching 0.47uF.\n5. Keep input return paths at the BM83 ground; keep charge-pump loops short and away from audio.\n6. ADAP_IN is left unused: the project already has an external charger. SYS_PWR and VDD_IO are internal-only.\n7. Amplifier uses the RTJ WQFN package; its footprint is assigned and exposed pad 21 is GND.\n8. Passive parts, connector styles and their footprints are deliberately generic."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 198.12 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "251816ee-631d-4e8a-828e-a521e592676b")
	)
	(text "Harness to J6 on Charging and Power. Connect 1 to 1, 2 to 2, 3 to 3."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 95.25 179.07 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "271f4f2b-dd9d-4c76-8477-23d7764e4607")
	)
	(text "APPLICATION NOTES"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 190.5 0)
